"], [5.278897, "content", ". Store result\n```\n\nStep"], [5.297489, "content", " 4"], [5.31617, "content", " cannot"], [5.334819, "content", " happen"], [5.353671, "content", " until step 3 is"], [5.371937, "content", " done."], [5.390735, "content", " But step"], [5.409212, "content", " 5"], [5.427362, "content", "’s"], [5.44588, "content", " address"], [5.464472, "content", " might be figured"], [5.482892, "content", " out earlier"], [5.501438, "content", ", or some"], [5.519923, "content", " other independent"], [5.538556, "content", " calculation"], [5.556979, "content", " might"], [5.575724, "content", " be ready before"], [5.594187, "content", " the main"], [5.612891, "content", " one.\n\nModern"], [5.631747, "content", " CPUs use"], [5.649977, "content", " **out-of-order execution**. That"], [5.668761, "content", " means the"], [5.687103, "content", " CPU can temporarily"], [5.705833, "content", " reorder work"], [5.724443, "content", " as"], [5.742668, "content", " long as the"], [5.761466, "content", " final result is"], [5.77983, "content", " still correct.\n\n###"], [5.798293, "content", " Anal"], [5.816775, "content", "ogy: cooking"], [5.835336, "content", " a meal"], [5.853742, "content", "\n\nImagine"], [5.872095, "content", " the"], [5.89047, "content", " chef"], [5.909312, "content", " needs"], [5.927953, "content", " to make"], [5.946226, "content", " pasta"], [5.964756, "content", " with"], [5.982977, "content", " sauce.\n\nThe recipe says"], [6.001383, "content", ":\n\n1. Bo"], [6.020008, "content", "il water"], [6.038765, "content", "  \n"], [6.057371, "content", "2. Start"], [6.075854, "content", " sauce  \n3. Cook pasta  \n4"], [6.094478, "content", ". Make"], [6.113041, "content", " garlic"], [6.131726, "content", " bread"], [6.150257, "content", "  \n5. Plate the"], [6.16887, "content", " meal"], [6.187334, "content", "  \n\nThe"], [6.205929, "content", " chef does"], [6.224796, "content", " not have to wait"], [6.242912, "content", " until"